"⟪k:0⟫Just how long are they going to maintain this stance?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regrettable, isn’t it, son?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫도대체 언제 체제가 바뀔는지……. ⟪k:1⟫이보게, ⟪k:2⟫자네 생각도 그렇지 않나."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C321C3A4_6D58_4BB7_851A_00C840018F87
