msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네――, ⟪k:1⟫전적으로…… 동감합니다. ⟪k:2⟫아사마 공."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0D361EF_F693_4D37_9F7C_121611B28CB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeb41d9e152f62b95dc1e0d8da144bb5bd706e29afc3317e6494b780ef1ba076
