"⟪k:0⟫Is it so difficult to be even the ⟪k:1⟫slightest⟪k:2⟫ bit accommodating to your fellow "
"countrymen?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫최소한 우리 동향 인간에게는 ⟪k:1⟫편의를 봐줘도 되겠거늘."

